{"step_index":180,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T09:02:51Z","input_tokens":3438,"cache_read_tokens":260586,"output_tokens":7604,"thinking":"Initial hypothesis: user wants to preserve the original long card string while grouping same-color cards into an outline structure at the bottom. This implies a transformation that maintains sequence but adds a visual grouping. The objective is to rearrange a structured output, retaining the initial order, and grouping cards of the same color beneath the long sequence.\n\n\nThe requirement is to visually represent the card groups at the bottom. Preserving the long card sequence is crucial; each card must remain distinct. When a bottom group contains k same-color cards, these must be enclosed within a single outline that encompasses the full height of the stacked cards. The outline must be visible on hover.\n\n\nThe visual representation requires a clean, layered presentation. The original sequence must remain visually intact, while same-color cards are grouped at the bottom with a clear outline. The top k-1 cards of a bottom group should expose only the card backs to maintain the sequence's apparent length. The last card in each bottom group displays the full card face with a badge and progress bar.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Playable HTML prototype (card_sort_cach_1_full_stack_outline.html) implementing Method 1 with full-length card cascades, a unified glowing outline wrapping the entire bottom same-color card group, and the k/Target counter + progress bar displayed on the bottom-most card.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","Content":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"vi\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\\\">\\n  <title>Cách 1 (Full Stack + Cụm Outline + Số & Progress ở Lá Cuối)</title>\\n  <style>\\n    * {\\n      box-sizing: border-box;\\n      margin: 0;\\n      padding: 0;\\n      user-select: none;\\n      -webkit-user-select: none;\\n    }\\n    body {\\n      background: #06170d;\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, sans-serif;\\n      display: flex;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      min-height: 100vh;\\n      padding: 8px;\\n    }\\n    #game-frame {\\n      position: relative;\\n      width: 420px;\\n      max-width: 100%;\\n      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #176537 0%, #114b29 70%, #0a331c 100%);\\n      border: 4px solid #082313;\\n      border-radius: 28px;\\n      padding: 14px;\\n      box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-direction: column;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n    }\\n    .header-bar {\\n      display: flex;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      padding-bottom: 8px;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\\n    }\\n    .title-area h1 {\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      color: #fef08a;\\n    }\\n    .title-area p {\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      color: #86efac;\\n    }\\n    .controls {\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 6px;\\n    }\\n    .stat-pill {\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n      color: #fef9c3;\\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\\n      padding: 4px 10px;\\n      border-radius: 12px;\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\\n    }\\n    .icon-btn {\\n      width: 32px;\\n      height: 32px;\\n      border-radius: 50%;\\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\\n     \n<truncated 18252 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\Admin\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\0ca39d47-bf1d-4d04-97dc-9